273
00:20:45,180 --> 00:20:48,480
You see somebody being used at your workplace.

274
00:20:48,480 --> 00:20:53,980
Being angry about that thing and wanting to see that injustice addressed, that is a desire.

275
00:20:53,980 --> 00:20:56,360
And that desire is not sinful.

276
00:20:56,360 --> 00:20:58,380
That is a good, godly desire.

277
00:20:58,380 --> 00:21:02,380
