00:27:32,720 --> 00:27:38,040
And if you really want to have your desires fulfilled, you believe that God isn't good.

360
00:27:38,040 --> 00:27:40,080
This is the lie that started it all.

361
00:27:40,080 --> 00:27:44,180
Adam and Eve believed that God was trying to keep something good from them.

362
00:27:44,180 --> 00:27:50,140
So, James is saying here, for us, if we want to have victory over temptation,

363
00:27:50,140 --> 00:27:53,640
we have to pay attention to what we believe about our desires.

364
00:27:53,640 --> 00:27:56,520
Do we believe that God is good?

365
00:27:56,520 --> 00:28:00,340
If so, then there is a good and righteous way to fulfill most of our desires.

