00:29:35,940 --> 00:29:39,980
There's a moment in time where we feel the pull.

392
00:29:39,980 --> 00:29:44,620
We feel the enemy, our flesh, the world, the devil lying to us and telling us,

393
00:29:44,620 --> 00:29:49,300
there is a way that you can satisfy this desire that is in opposition to God's will.

394
00:29:49,380 --> 00:29:51,060
And I promise you, it will feel good.

395
00:29:51,060 --> 00:29:53,400
It will satisfy you.

396
00:29:53,400 --> 00:29:54,280
It will reward you.

397
00:29:54,280 --> 00:29:56,740
There's a moment in time where we feel the pull.

398
00:29:56,740 --> 00:29:58,940
We feel ourselves being lied to.

